2.
Definitions
.-In these rules, unless the context otherwise requires,--
(a)
"Act" means the National Council of Teacher Education Act, 1993 (
73 of 1993
);
(b)
"application form" means the application form appended to these rules;
(c)
"Certificate" means a certificate specified in Appendix to these rules;
(d)
"section" means section of the Act;
(e)
all other words and expressions used and not defined in these rules but defined in the Act shall have the same
meanings respectively assigned to them in the Act.
